{
  "version": 1,
  "id": "building-group-candidate-visual-grounding",
  "description": "Candidate-slice VisualRelationGraph fixture. Promoted warehouse, parking, drive-aisle, and tree-row candidates must match pixel-grounded top-view evidence, not layout-prior boxes.",
